locality: x, y and z of the clause's fork agree with the fork run with its threads delayed into another order in 3 of 3
seeding: x is the first value of a thread seeded with 100: 1, y and z agree with threads seeded by hand with the parent's second and third next values in 2 of 2
subtree: a subtree whose root seeds itself with 77 draws alike from two places of the parent in 4 of 4
